# === Curated synthesis artifacts (small, intentionally committed) ===
# The blanket logs/ reports/ *.log rules above exist to keep ORFS build output
# out of git. These are the hand-picked Yosys + STA artifacts the Day 4 note
# cites, ~745 KB total. Parent dirs must be re-included before their contents,
# otherwise git never descends into them.
!synth-experiments/**/logs/
!synth-experiments/**/logs/**
!synth-experiments/**/reports/
!synth-experiments/**/reports/**

# Day 5 PDK slices + arc-delay check are tiny (~30 KB) and are the artifacts the
# day5 writeup cites, so keep them despite the blanket reports/ rule above.
# (*.lib stays ignored; the extracted cell is saved as inv_2_cell.txt, not .lib.)
!pdk-experiments/reports/
!pdk-experiments/reports/**

